oice\" is displayed as (like we do with some settings in the class reference). Either way, you could consider using editor help's code font to display the values. \r\nEither way, the whole **RichTextLabel** \"list of enums\" in the tooltip will always be a bit messy, no matter what we do.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3393554435/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4794145782","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102734#issuecomment-4794145782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102734","id":4794145782,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHcDb9g","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T22:21:23Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T22:21:23Z","body":"So, how exactly is this displayed in the current version of this PR? Has my comment been accounted for?","author_associati